---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import {vnScenes} from '../lib/vn-scenes';
import {rectStyle} from '../lib/vn-control';
const confirmSettings=[['overwrite','覆盖手动存档'],['load','读取手动存档'],['qsave','快速存档'],['qload','读取快速存档'],['delete','删除存档']] as const;
const original=import.meta.env.DEV&&!!process.env.GINKA_VN_UI_DATA;
const privateAsset=(name:string)=>`url(/__ginka_local_ui__/${name}.png)`;
const geometry=vnScenes.privateUI.optionGeometry;
const tabSkin=(key:string)=>original?['normal','selected','hover'].map(state=>`--vn-tab-${state}:${privateAsset('optionTabs-nav-'+key+'-'+state)}`).join(';'):undefined;
const footerSkin=(key:'title'|'back'|'defaults')=>original?rectStyle(geometry.controls[key],[0,0,...geometry.canvas])+';'+['normal','hover','pressed'].map(state=>`--vn-footer-${state}:${privateAsset('optionTabs-footer-'+key+'-'+state)}`).join(';'):undefined;
const headingSkin=original?Object.keys(geometry.headings).map(key=>`--vn-heading-${key}:${privateAsset(key+'Labels-wordmark')}`).join(';'):undefined;
const displaySkin=(key:'window'|'fullscreen'|'effectOn'|'effectOff')=>original?['normal','selected','hover'].map(state=>`--vn-display-${state}:${privateAsset('displayLabels-control-'+key+'-'+state)}`).join(';'):undefined;
const commonSkin=original?[
 '--vn-option-art:'+privateAsset('option'),'--vn-option-atlas:'+privateAsset('optionAtlas'),'--vn-option-caption:'+privateAsset('optionAtlas-caption'),
 ...['normal','selected','hover'].map(state=>'--vn-option-button-'+state+':'+privateAsset('optionAtlas-button-'+state)),
 ...['rail','railDisabled','thumb','thumbHover','thumbPressed'].map(state=>'--vn-option-range-'+state+':'+privateAsset('optionAtlas-range-'+state))
].join(';'):undefined;
const tabs=[['display','DISPLAY'],['program','PROGRAM'],['text','TEXT'],['sound','SOUND'],['dialog','DIALOG'],['touch','TOUCH'],['shortcut','SHORTCUT']];
---
<Layout title="系统设置" kind="home" noindex>
 <section class="vn-stage vn-option" data-vn-screen="config" data-vn-ui-original={String(original)} style={commonSkin} aria-labelledby="vn-option-title">
  <div class="vn-option-frame">
   <header class="vn-option-header vn-panel-header"><h1 id="vn-option-title" data-vn-heading-key="display" style={headingSkin}><span data-vn-option-heading>DISPLAY</span> <small>Setting</small></h1><aside class="vn-option-help" aria-label="设置说明"><span>HELP WINDOW</span><p data-vn-option-help>调整画面尺寸与表现方式</p></aside></header>
   <div data-vn-config hidden>
    <nav class="vn-option-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="系统设置">{tabs.map(([key,label],i)=><button type="button" id={'vn-tab-'+key} role="tab" aria-controls={'vn-option-'+key} aria-selected={i===0} tabindex={i===0?0:-1} data-vn-option-tab={key} style={tabSkin(key)}><strong>{label}</strong><small>{key==='shortcut'?'List':'Setting'}</small></button>)}</nav>
    <div class="vn-option-body">
     <section id="vn-option-display" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="vn-tab-display" data-vn-option-panel="display">
      <div class="vn-option-grid">
       <fieldset data-vn-display-group="window"><legend>画面尺寸</legend><div class="vn-option-buttons"><button type="button" data-vn-display-control data-vn-window="window" aria-pressed="true" style={displaySkin('window')}>窗口</button><button type="button" data-vn-display-control data-vn-window="full" aria-pressed="false" style={displaySkin('fullscreen')}>全屏</button></div></fieldset>
       <fieldset data-vn-display-group="effect"><legend>画面效果</legend><div class="vn-option-buttons"><label data-vn-display-control style={displaySkin('effectOn')}><input type="radio" name="vn-motion" value="system"/> ON</label><label data-vn-display-control style={displaySkin('effectOff')}><input type="radio" name="vn-motion" value="reduced"/> OFF</label></div></fieldset>
       <fieldset data-vn-display-group="mode"><legend>画面表现</legend><div class="vn-option-buttons"><label><input type="radio" name="vn-mode" value="game"/> 游戏</label><label><input type="radio" name="vn-mode" value="reader"/> 阅读</label></div></fieldset>
       <fieldset data-vn-display-group="theme"><legend>阅读模式主题</legend><div class="vn-option-buttons"><button type="button" data-vn-theme="day" aria-pressed="false">日间</button><button type="button" data-vn-theme="moonlit" aria-pressed="false">月夜</button><button type="button" data-vn-theme="system" aria-pressed="true">跟随系统</button></div><p>只调整阅读界面；原作画面不随主题变色</p></fieldset>
       <fieldset data-vn-display-group="speed"><legend>演出速度 · 博客适配</legend><div class="vn-option-slider"><span>0.5×</span><input type="range" min="0.5" max="2" step="0.25" value="1" data-vn-playback="effectSpeed" aria-label="演出速度倍率"/><span>2×</span><output data-vn-playback-value="effectSpeed">1</output></div><p>只调整既有演出时钟；不会改写原作动作参数。</p></fieldset><p data-vn-display-feedback class="vn-option-wide" role="status"></p>
      </div>
     </section>
     <section id="vn-option-program" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="vn-tab-program" data-vn-option-panel="program" hidden>
      <div class="vn-option-grid">
       <fieldset><legend>阅读记录</legend><div class="vn-option-buttons"><a href="/library/">LOAD</a><a href="/archives/">章节选择</a></div></fieldset>
       <fieldset><legend>看板娘</legend><div class="vn-option-buttons"><label>角色 <select data-vn-mascot-character disabled><option value="all">全部</option></select></label><label>服装 <select data-vn-mascot-outfit disabled><option value="all">全部服装</option></select></label><label>表情 <select data-vn-mascot-expression disabled><option value="all">全部表情</option></select></label><label>姿势 <select data-vn-mascot-gesture disabled><option value="all">全部姿势</option></select></label><label>字幕语言 <select data-vn-mascot-language aria-label="字幕语言" disabled><option value="zh-CN">简体中文</option><option value="ja" disabled>日本語 · 暂不可用</option><option value="en" disabled>English · 暂不可用</option></select></label></div><div class="vn-option-buttons"><button type="button" data-mascot-action="preview" disabled>预览当前角色</button></div><p>仅显示当前已解锁且经过核验的角色、服装与差分；字幕语言只作用于本次会话，不改变日文录音，也不将预览图冒充对应语音。</p></fieldset><fieldset><legend>阅读模式</legend><div class="vn-option-buttons"><a href="/#latest" data-vn-mode-set="reader">阅读索引</a><a href="/" data-vn-mode-set="game">标题画面</a></div></fieldset>
      </div>
     </section>
     <section id="vn-option-text" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="vn-tab-text" data-vn-option-panel="text" hidden>
      <div class="vn-option-grid">
       <fieldset><legend>正文文字大小</legend><div class="vn-option-slider"><span>MIN</span><input type="range" min="14" max="22" step="1" value="16" data-vn-text-size aria-label="正文文字大小"/><span>MAX</span><output data-vn-text-value>16</output></div></fieldset>
       <fieldset><legend>文字显示示例</legend><p class="vn-text-sample" data-vn-text-sample>在姬之岛的夏日里，记录每一次阅读</p></fieldset>
       <fieldset><legend>对白逐字间隔</legend><div class="vn-option-slider"><span>0</span><input type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="30" data-vn-playback="textRevealMs" aria-label="对白逐字间隔毫秒"/><span>100ms</span><output data-vn-playback-value="textRevealMs">30</output></div><p>0 为立即显示。作用于已验证的本地对白，不延缓博客正文。</p></fieldset>
       <fieldset><legend>AUTO 对白间隔</legend><div class="vn-option-slider"><span>0</span><input type="range" min="0" max="5000" step="100" value="700" data-vn-playback="autoGapMs" aria-label="AUTO对白间隔毫秒"/><span>5s</span><output data-vn-playback-value="autoGapMs">700</output></div><p>对白文字显示与语音结束后，再等待此间隔。</p></fieldset>
       <fieldset><legend>AUTO 正文滚动</legend><div class="vn-option-slider"><span>10</span><input type="range" min="10" max="180" step="5" value="45" data-vn-playback="autoScrollSpeed" aria-label="AUTO正文滚动速度"/><span>180px/s</span><output data-vn-playback-value="autoScrollSpeed">45</output></div></fieldset>
       <fieldset><legend>SKIP 方式</legend><div class="vn-confirm-settings"><label><input type="checkbox" data-vn-playback="skipSeenOnly" checked/><span>只跳过已有实际播放记录的对白</span></label></div><p>博客适配偏好，不对应原作已读 flags；不会跳入未绑定剧情。</p></fieldset>
       <p class="vn-option-wide">以上默认值是博客偏好，非原作默认参数；恢复默认不会清除实际语音历史。</p>
      </div>
     </section>
     <section id="vn-option-sound" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="vn-tab-sound" data-vn-option-panel="sound" hidden>
      <div class="vn-option-grid" data-vn-music>
       <fieldset data-vn-sound-bgm style={original?'--vn-sound-caption:'+privateAsset('optionAtlas-sound-caption')+';--vn-sound-label:'+privateAsset('soundLabels-label3')+';--vn-option-range-rail:'+privateAsset('optionAtlas-sound-range-rail')+';--vn-option-range-railDisabled:'+privateAsset('optionAtlas-sound-range-railDisabled'):undefined}><legend>BGM 音量</legend><div class="vn-option-slider"><span>MIN</span><input type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="88" data-vn-volume aria-label="BGM 音量"/><span>MAX</span><output data-vn-volume-value>88</output></div><div class="vn-option-buttons"><button type="button" data-vn-music-action="music-volume-toggle">静音</button><button type="button" data-vn-music-action="music-toggle">播放</button><button type="button" data-vn-music-action="music-next">下一首</button></div></fieldset>
       <fieldset><legend>正在播放</legend><div class="vn-option-track"><span data-vn-music-title>读取歌单中</span><small data-vn-music-artist></small><progress data-vn-music-progress max="1" value="0" aria-label="播放进度"></progress><small data-vn-music-time></small></div><p data-vn-music-feedback role="status" hidden></p></fieldset>
       <fieldset><legend>VOICE / 银花语音</legend><div class="vn-option-slider"><span>MIN</span><input type="range" min="0" max="100" value="80" data-vn-voice-volume aria-label="语音音量"/><span>MAX</span><output data-vn-voice-value>80</output></div><div class="vn-option-buttons"><button type="button" data-vn-voice-mute aria-pressed="false">静音</button><button type="button" data-vn-voice-replay disabled>回放</button><button type="button" data-vn-voice-stop disabled>停止</button></div><p data-vn-voice-playing aria-live="polite">语音未播放</p><p data-vn-voice-feedback role="status"></p><p data-vn-voice-status>原作语音需要本地素材包</p></fieldset><fieldset><legend>VOICE SAVE / 语音收藏</legend><div data-vn-voice-saved></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>SE / 系统效果音</legend><p>当前素材包尚未绑定经过核验的系统效果音，不播放替代音效。</p></fieldset><fieldset class="vn-option-wide"><legend>音乐列表</legend><div data-vn-track-list class="vn-option-playlist"></div><p data-vn-track-status role="status">正在读取歌单</p><button type="button" data-vn-music-action="music-source-retry">刷新歌单</button></fieldset>
      </div>
     </section>
     <section id="vn-option-dialog" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="vn-tab-dialog" data-vn-option-panel="dialog" hidden>
      <div class="vn-option-grid"><fieldset><legend>存读档确认</legend><div class="vn-confirm-settings">{confirmSettings.map(([key,label])=><label><input type="checkbox" data-vn-confirm-setting={key} checked/><span>{label}前确认</span></label>)}</div><p>博客默认全部开启；不改变存档内容。清除全部记录与恢复默认设置始终确认。</p></fieldset><fieldset><legend>清除本机阅读记录</legend><div class="vn-option-buttons"><button type="button" data-vn-reset>清除阅读存档与收藏</button></div><p>将清除阅读进度、150 个手动档、快速档与文章收藏；不会删除语音收藏。</p></fieldset></div>
     </section>
     <section id="vn-option-touch" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="vn-tab-touch" data-vn-option-panel="touch" hidden>
      <div class="vn-option-grid"><fieldset><legend>触屏操作</legend><p>点击选择，滑动浏览文章和存档列表</p></fieldset><fieldset><legend>返回</legend><p>使用界面下方返回按钮，不拦截系统手势</p></fieldset></div>
     </section>
     <section id="vn-option-shortcut" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="vn-tab-shortcut" data-vn-option-panel="shortcut" hidden>
      <div class="vn-option-grid"><fieldset><legend>菜单与设置页签</legend><p>↑ / ↓ 选择菜单；← / → 切换设置页；Home / End 到首尾；Enter 确认</p></fieldset><fieldset><legend>文章检索</legend><p>Ctrl / Command + K</p></fieldset><fieldset><legend>弹窗操作</legend><p>Tab / Shift + Tab 在弹窗内移动；Esc 取消；确认框 ← / → 切换 YES / NO，Enter 确认当前选择</p></fieldset><fieldset><legend>恢复设置</legend><p>DEFAULT 只重置当前页；Shift + DEFAULT 或“恢复全部公共设置”重置全部设置，不清除阅读与语音收藏</p></fieldset></div>
     </section>
    </div>
    <footer class="vn-option-footer"><button type="button" data-vn-option-default title="恢复当前页，按住 Shift 恢复全部公共设置" aria-label="恢复当前页默认设置，Shift 恢复全部公共设置" style={footerSkin('defaults')}>DEFAULT<small>默认设置</small></button><a href="/" data-vn-option-back style={footerSkin('back')}>BACK<small>返回</small></a><a href="/" data-vn-mode-set="game" style={footerSkin('title')}>TITLE<small>标题</small></a></footer>
    <button class="vn-option-reset-all" type="button" data-vn-option-default="all">恢复全部公共设置</button><p class="journal-visually-hidden" data-vn-option-feedback role="status"></p>
   </div>
   <noscript><p>系统设置需要 JavaScript，<a href="/">返回标题</a></p></noscript>
  </div>
 </section>
</Layout>
